NativeSupporterVault::fundRefundableRecovery
├── Given caller is not Safe, bucket/state invalid, or quantity zero
│   └── It rejects
├── Given any original exported backing has not been returned
│   └── It cannot mislabel that original principal/carry as refundable new backing
└── Given separately authenticated Safe contribution after full original return
    └── It increments repair backing and its refundable subset exactly once, emitting a distinct funding event
